Package: frsandre
Title: Access and Retrieve Data from SANDRE Web Services
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
   person("Matthieu", "CHEVEREAU", , "matthieu.chevereau@forestiere.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides tools to access and retrieve geographic and 
   descriptive data from the French National Service for Water Data and Referential Management (SANDRE). 
   Includes functions to query SANDRE web services (WFS and WMS), discover available resources, 
   and retrieve spatial data for use in R workflows.
